      "description": "A library to support complex camera ISPs",
      "note": "This fixes a wrong path used in the build script, causing the modules from libcamera-ipa not being signed, resulting in possible libcamera malfunction. See https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2547048.\nOne way to check this is to install `libcamera-ipa` + `libcamera-tools` and run `sudo modprobe vimc` + `LIBCAMERA_LOG_LEVELS=DEBUG cam -l`. It should report a valid signature of /usr/lib64/libcamera/ipa/ipa_vimc.so rather than an error."
    },
